        "applicationExercise": "Pull your company's six core commercial metrics for the last 12 months and build a trend chart for each. For any metric that has moved in the wrong direction for two or more consecutive months, conduct a root cause analysis: is the root cause a process problem (how leads are qualified, advanced, or converted), a people problem (capability or capacity gap in the commercial team), or a strategic problem (value proposition, competitive position, or target segment)? For the metric with the most sustained negative trend, design a 90-day intervention with specific owner, specific actions, and specific success criteria.",
